{"_note":"评论页 v40(路由 /reviews?appId=…&country=…):最新 ≤50 条用户评论的完整列表 —— 顶行(条数 · 地区 · 取数时刻)+ 星级分布 + 逐条评论(30 条渲染槽,按 rvN 截断)+ 页脚。数据与详情页共用 page/flow/reviews.df 的同一份缓存(键 c.aw.rv.<appId>_<country>),从详情页点进来零额外网络。","type":"page","id":"appwatch-reviews","root":{"type":"container","id":"root","title":"${nm}","layout":"list","direction":"vertical","gap":"10pt","_notePad":"左右内边距恒 **14pt**(page-design-system.md §5)。上下留白读 `@contentInset`(容器 standard 顶栏浮在内容之上),与 app.xpage 同治。","padding":"14pt","paddingTop":"${@contentInset.top}pt","paddingBottom":"24pt","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-reviews.df]","params":{"app":"${appId}","b":"${bundleId}","n":"","_cache":1},"_note":"只有确认在账号里的 App(amine_<id>)才打 ASC;否则零请求、走下面的公开流。"},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/reviews.df]","params":{"appId":"${appId}","bundleId":"${bundleId}","country":"${country}","_cache":1,"w":"${@window.width}"},"_note":"`_cache:1` = G23 三态。appId/country 来自路由 query(routeParams,§7.2 最低优先级)—— 与 app.xpage 同一条纪律:不能在 root.params 写兜底。"}],"items":[{"_note":"账号里的 App:ASC 全部地区评论 + 回复状态 + 筛选。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"container","id":"ascRv","layout":"list","direction":"vertical","gap":"0pt","items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"sum","h":"116pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-rvsum.rcn]"},"_note":"摘要卡:卡面 104 + 卡下 12pt 透明留白(gap=0 后间距烤进画布)。"},{"_note":"筛选行:0 全部 / 1 低分 / 2 未回复。chip 高亮从 pageState 键 rvf 直读;切换 = patchState,不重新取数。","type":"container","id":"chips","layout":"flex","direction":"horizontal","gap":"6pt","items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"fc0","w":"86pt","h":"30pt","params":{"idx":0},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-rvf0.af]","params":{}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-fchip.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"fc1","w":"86pt","h":"30pt","params":{"idx":1},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-rvf1.af]","params":{}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-fchip.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"fc2","w":"86pt","h":"30pt","params":{"idx":2},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-rvf2.af]","params":{}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-fchip.rcn]"}}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"capt","h":"22pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-lcapt.rcn]"},"_note":"列表组顶帽:12pt 透明段 + 10pt 圆角白帽(筛选后首末行不可知,圆角进不了行本体)。"},{"_note":"定长 30 槽;显隐 = 槽有效 × 当前筛选。pageState 的 rvf 缺省 0(全部)。","op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${rvl}","key":"q","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(lt::(${i},${nRv}),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rvf},0),1),${q.lo},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rvf},0),2),${q.nr},1)),0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"rv-${i}","h":"96pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-rvcard.rcn]"},"params":{"st":"${q.st}","tt":"${q.tt}","bd":"${q.bd}","n":"${q.n}","d":"${q.d}","nr":"${q.nr}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/review?id=${q.id}&app=${aid}"}}]}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"capb","h":"22pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-lcapb.rcn]"}}],"_note":"私有面评论列表(摘要 · 筛选 · 分割线列表):行与行必须贴合,故单独一层 gap=0。"}]},{"_note":"其他 App:公开评论(按地区)。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"head","h":"28pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-all-head.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"dist","h":"${distH}pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-dist.rcn]"}},{"_note":"v42:评论按 10 条一组合成分割线卡(三组);单张 30 行的位图在 3× 屏上近 40MB,拆组是为了内存。组内行 y 与组高由数据层算。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"revg0","h":"${revHg0}pt","params":{"g":"0","lim":"30","more":"0"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-list.rcn]"}}]},{"_note":"第 2 组(第 11–20 条),rvN 不够就整组不渲。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0),10),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"revg1","h":"${revHg1}pt","params":{"g":"1","lim":"30","more":"0"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-list.rcn]"}}]},{"_note":"第 3 组(第 21–30 条),rvN 不够就整组不渲。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0),20),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"revg2","h":"${revHg2}pt","params":{"g":"2","lim":"30","more":"0"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-list.rcn]"}}]}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"foot","h":"74pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-foot.rcn]"}}],"events":{"_note":"`onLoad`:三态的中间那一行 —— 首屏若渲的是旧货就后台校新一次(gate 全生命周期恰好一次;⚠️ 别改挂 onVisible)。入参用 reviews.df 改名透出的 rv_stale/rvkey。\n`onRefresh`:下拉由 refresh-reviews.af 负责(删评论缓存键再 reloadPage)。","onLoad":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/revalidate.af]","params":{"stale":"${rv_stale}","ckey":"${rvkey}"}},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-reviews-revalidate.af]","params":{"stale":"${m_stale}","ckey":"${mckey}"}}],"onRefresh":"@[file://page/flow/refresh-reviews.af]"}}}
